+# Reconciliation runbook
+
+1. Match the payout identifier with the settlement-provider reference.
+2. Confirm the recorded amount and currency.
+3. Escalate any mismatch to a finance administrator.
+4. Never edit an existing payout record to hide a mismatch.
+
+This runbook changes no executable payout behavior.
